### 1. Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders


### 2. Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/1


### 3. Create a new order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Hana",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 25000,
  "teleBirrPhone": "0912345678"
}


### 4. Test negative total (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Abel",
  "area": "Piazza",
  "totalSantim": -5
}


### 5. Test extra field (should be stripped)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Sara",
  "area": "Mexico",
  "totalSantim": 30000,
  "password": "secret"
}


### 6. Test an order that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/999